rows.en:
I begged for my life... or I wanted to, but I couldn't.
I was locked in sleep paralysis.
My face was reflected clear as day in Yoshioka's hand mirror...{p}

Right then, the demon vanished, just like that.
Looked like it went off somewhere because the mirror broke.
We ran for it as fast as we could.{p}

Yoshioka got hit by a car.
No, to be exact, Yoshioka's hand got crushed under a wheel...
For a while the blood didn't spread across the ground; as fast as it flowed out, it vanished, whoosh, whoosh.{p}
